{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/812","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/812/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/812/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/812/events","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/812","id":107713741,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMDc3MTM3NDE=","number":812,"title":"mediaChunks list handling in ChunkSampleSource is not robust against initial sample skipping","user":{"login":"Bastian35022","id":14124625,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTI0NjI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14124625?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022","html_url":"https://github.com/Bastian35022","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bastian35022/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":106814989,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDY4MTQ5ODk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2015-09-22T13:21:27Z","updated_at":"2021-05-14T13:58:18Z","closed_at":"2015-09-28T11:41:00Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In the `readData` method of `ChunkSampleSource`, some entries of the `mediaChunks` member are (sometimes) removed in this section:\n\n```\nBaseMediaChunk currentChunk = mediaChunks.getFirst();\nwhile (haveSamples && mediaChunks.size() > 1\n    && mediaChunks.get(1).getFirstSampleIndex() == sampleQueue.getReadIndex()) {\n  mediaChunks.removeFirst();\n  currentChunk = mediaChunks.getFirst();\n}\n```\n\nNow, if some samples are skipped initially (e.g. if the content does not start with a sync sample), the read index can be higher than the value returned by `mediaChunks.get(1).getFirstSampleIndex()`, avoiding the removal of chunks from the list in general. This leads to a wrong assignment of `currentChunk`.\n\nI guess it could simply be solved by making the `==` a `<=`, which at least works for me.\n","closed_by":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/812/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/812/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}